      "notes": "K2's own: the (i) help button. K2Help.tip(text, {label, key, title}) returns an (i) that shows a tooltip on hover or focus and pins it on click, tap, Enter or Space; text over 160 characters opens a popover with Close instead. Esc, a tap outside or the same (i) closes it; it stays inside the frame and follows the Garden's light/dark. Markup works too: class=\"k2h-btn\" with data-tip, or data-help=\"<id>\" for a popover. Put explanations behind an (i), not on the canvas."
