      "notes": "K2's own: the activity bar K2's Conversation shows, for one agent. K2Activity.mount(el, {address: 'handle::host', look: 'chamfer', 'glass' or 'plain'}) then bar.setAddress(address), bar.setLook(look), bar.destroy(). It listens with k2.thread.onActivity (caps thread:read and activity:read): the turn an App guest gets, counts and step kinds, never text. Working pulses; monitoring, needs-you and a quiet turn never do (no typing dots); an end shows Done, Stopped or Failed briefly. K2Activity.describe(K2Activity.coerce(state.turn, Date.now()), Date.now()) gives {tone, headline, animate, counters, clock, aria, detail} for your own drawing. No turn means no bar: never guess from messages. Colours follow the Garden (--zen-*, or --k2a-*)."
