      "notes": "K2's own: diffs for the Workbench and your own review widgets. K2Diff.render(el, await k2.git.diffFile(address, {file}), {view: 'unified' or 'split', wrap, ignoreWhitespace, context: 3, onLine(info)}) draws a file's change (binary, too large, new and deleted files in plain words; long unchanged runs fold behind Expand N lines; onLine puts a + on each line for a note: {file, side, line, text}). K2Diff.tree(el, files, {selected, onSelect(file)}) draws the changed files as a folder tree with status letters and +/− counts. K2Diff.lines(oldText, newText, {ignoreWhitespace}), K2Diff.hunks(lines, {context}) and K2Diff.stats(lines) give the diff as data. Add highlight.js@11 to your libs for colours (from the file's extension). Text is only ever text (no innerHTML); colours follow the Garden (--zen-*)."
